{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "748974baffb4d3bc36238a765fbbbd361ddccdfc91f7dea61ba05b0d1a1f40da", "ja": "星をつないで", "zh": "连起繁星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f465ef386b941db57e61d7ec8432f31dda64b12724d53f7f6f989fa54e374d44", "ja": "春香、伊織に勇気をもらった雪歩は、貴音と\n共に司会をしたいと申し出る。これまでの天\n体公演がそうだったように、皆で手を取り合\nい、つないでいこう。そう気付いた貴音は雪\n歩の申し出を受け入れ、共に司会に臨む。", "zh": "从春香和伊织那里获得勇气的雪歩，主动提出想与贵音一同担任主持。就像以往的天体公演一样，大家携手相连，共同前行。意识到这一点的贵音接受了雪歩的提议，与她一同迎接主持工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "15d94959cb6d728379ea380bdf3d85dc39c463ecb7475396f9f7fa99995650b8", "ja": "（局では今後の方針会議が続いている。\nこちらの意向は伝えて、今は待機中だ）", "zh": "（电视台还在继续开今后的方针会议。\n我们的意向已经传达了，现在先等着吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0d92658386f88edcea2ac64c15561175abf0d2787a84e51a9705af6775065e15", "ja": "台本調整するとは言ってたけど、尺自体は変わりそうに\nない。となると、貴音は出ずっぱりになるんじゃ……。", "zh": "虽然说是会调整剧本，但节目时长本身似乎\n不会变。这么一来，贵音不就得全程出镜了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "24766369d0acc44173a0cdc32ad10b21693b388785f8c7b535fd13cdae90cbc1", "ja": "……期待に応えることには慣れています。\nこの試練、必ず乗り越えてみせましょう。", "zh": "……回应期待这种事，我早已习惯了。\n这场考验，我定会克服给您看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "38337b7d6fa172465a0f6543f860180caf6ae1235b602b1d224c5e5dca52da79", "ja": "ですから、どうぞ見守っていてください。\n私は他ならぬ、あなた様のアイドルです。", "zh": "所以，请您尽管注视着我。\n我可是只属于您的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c040b6248eb2ae4917cf3b757a4ff670ecdf6a08e753767735a4f5a2f58f5c6", "ja": "（貴音の決意は固い。実際やり遂げてもくれるだろう。\nただ、単純に負荷が高すぎる……）", "zh": "（贵音的决心很坚定。她实际上一​​定也能完成。只是，这负担也太重了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1006_se", "source_sha256": "b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e", "ja": "ガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ac8f55e124a5b20a009cfc890d2f869d29ef06b13931e733e6926a1a72e6928", "ja": "ま、待ってくださいぃーっ！", "zh": "等、等一下啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b38c7fd4562354ecba84c7c808c589a29be8d81a0b50d4248959645b9a039038", "ja": "あれ、雪歩？", "zh": "哎，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "7fbe0e3685d88ff83d731bca175edebe8ef50bf88688d18d2e63117c28398764", "ja": "どうしたのですか？　そのような剣幕で……。", "zh": "您这是怎么了？怎么一副气势汹汹的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0f520b7052040deb469195579832e14e216e10e1fe9fab73ab89724470e11e9a", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……四条さん、{$P$}！\nわ、私に……私に司会を手伝わせてくださいっ！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……四条小姐，{$P$}！\n请、请让我……让我帮忙主持吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "78efc1514f50dcbbaa05a8d8f0b515c4577919d5cc6b5b13e94ae014ec32e007", "ja": "私なら四条さんとスケジュールも合います、\n合わせられます！　だから……、でき、できますぅ！", "zh": "我的日程也能和四条小姐对上，我、我会调整好的！所以……我、我能做到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "9c3544ae35e6b97583b8bf1b92b1d0096578fe672e81fab3169359d43c607662", "ja": "雪歩……心配を掛けてしまっているようですが、\n言ったはずです。私なら大丈夫だと。", "zh": "雪步……看起来好像让你担心了，不过我应该说过，我没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "24a5df6b39e2601ffaeb582930c7706f51a335c2b9af1aa9ad9e19bfff296a1f", "ja": "『ステラ』の一員として、必ずや……。", "zh": "作为『Stella』的一员，我一定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "88902d80304a089982283ba7e13d7c7149e49ee9fc4b15d720559050b01c63ee", "ja": "違うんです、四条さん！　四条さんが心配で、\nフォローしたいとかじゃないんです……。", "zh": "不是这样的，四条小姐！不是因为担心四条小姐，想帮您解围什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d65ee200679bd7d6bcc2de7f7d593e21ffad100d950f9bd78f4630ed3b423cb7", "ja": "ただ……私が、四条さんと一緒に、\n司会をしてみたいだけなんです！", "zh": "只是……我只是想和四条小姐一起，试着担任主持人而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b6a405385d1be9ed3aa2735c3d4acaea19222da4a8fcc1002475d9e191397ae2", "ja": "司会の席に、一人でいる四条さんを想像して、\nその後ろに、私や春香ちゃん、伊織ちゃんがいる……。", "zh": "想象四条同学一个人在主持席上，\n而我和春香、伊织就在她身后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3562031ad7b10d91a95ab2bd39e140ab13019840e92cd0efd0012ced61b69cc1", "ja": "何度も想像してみたけど……きっと四条さんの隣に\nいられた方が、私は絶対、嬉しいんです！", "zh": "我试着想象了好多次……但我肯定还是更希望\n能待在四条小姐身边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "412925ca1a09fe419aa96e9a2edbbab0bb31258e75cfcdaff852f1c437637a1d", "ja": "雪歩……。\nですが、この土壇場からでは……。", "zh": "雪步……。\n可是，都到了这个关头……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1020_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "ca7045bc8ca448c5f37bc683a1a6b52502f1688fc5269155b367c6f737c5232d", "ja": "土壇場だけど、どうせ台本は書き直すんでしょ？\nなら、やってみればいいじゃない。", "zh": "虽然事到临头了，但反正剧本都要重写对吧？\n既然这样，试一下不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "0649fefca65a321f4403baf90ebfbff001d36cc4facc902597f036077527ca8a", "ja": "それに、雪歩は全然迷惑じゃないっていうか、\nやりたいだけなんでしょ？", "zh": "而且，雪步根本不会觉得麻烦，应该只是想做吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c430c11a4bfea5e71416af951598a35a3f86c8f86283cc68da0017480a431302", "ja": "うんっ！　四条さんと一緒だから！", "zh": "嗯！因为能和四条小姐在一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "c27ef916ae132252da791116958eab36a420116b0de8f664a38df14dc63d7872", "ja": "貴音さん、私思ったんです。考えてみたら、\nこれまでの天体公演も、そうだったなって。", "zh": "贵音，我想到了一件事。仔细想想，以前的天体公演也是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "b23e57975295d7a8c662658cc615cfef629045aa4a2a508ddf7607b70c2c9f05", "ja": "劇場のみんなが、次の公演にバトンを渡すみたいに、\n次から次へと思いを引き継いでいって……。", "zh": "剧场的大家就像要把接力棒交给下一场公演一样，一个接一个地传承着这份心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "2bb0c1c7f54a2d2879cee140781c853906d953235f28688ce0539dab7c7d65eb", "ja": "そうやって、みんなで繋いできた公演だから……。\n貴音さんも、一人じゃない方がいいと思います！", "zh": "正因为这场公演是大家这样一棒接一棒传承下来的……所以我觉得，贵音小姐还是不要一个人比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "58d3209da43487dc0062d9abba1fc4c9dba02b3008975e9481c85fca4d234e2d", "ja": "そ、それは……。\n{$P$}、よろしいのですか？", "zh": "那、那是……。\n{$P$}，这样真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "98481db1e9353404e30b54c599c2cc193300dd7dae9732ca47e7a36fcff2999b", "ja": "雪歩が手伝ってくれるなら、台本の直しは\n少なくて済む。先方は喜ぶんじゃないかな。", "zh": "如果雪步愿意帮忙，需要修改的剧本内容就会少一些。对方应该会很高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6944ed7e445489de6dad725486c3204987d2e1b2fc8c3f55a2ae8a78fd6642ce", "ja": "だから、あとは……\n二人で手を取り合えるかどうかだ。", "zh": "所以，接下来……就看你们两个人能不能携手合作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "d1e04b5a4bad524e2060530d8a113c2e346120eb263a458036da5b02b4bfd461", "ja": "……そう、ですか。では……。\n春香、伊織、申し訳ありません。", "zh": "……这样，啊。那么……\n春香、伊织，十分抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "798832508f77899a510c38256eb09113debcfafebd59f9531d8937befacc0abd", "ja": "そして、ありがとうございます。\n私も頑なになっていたようです。", "zh": "还有，谢谢你们。\n看来我也变得固执了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a2f71513fd939cf2e3f136d762424b639b0454be73c763b2c222f2c5430e7ca", "ja": "特番も、天体公演も……皆で繋いでいきましょう。\nそして、雪歩……一緒にお願いできますか？", "zh": "特别节目和天体公演……让我们也一起携手延续下去吧。\n还有，雪步……可以和我一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "60c3ef55fb81e0c7894a39cb76ed031672b8344b8e16c4a4d75dfdd34d995621", "ja": "っ！　は、はいっ……お願いします、四条さん！", "zh": "！好、好的……拜托您了，四条小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "92f61d620b65379007b76251f692b2b87d6f40ecfacbc5bf29e9fa479b2d962e", "ja": "よし、話はまとまったな。改めて先方に伝えるよ。\nこうなった以上、やれること全部やりきろう！", "zh": "好，事情就这么定下来了。我会再正式通知对方。\n既然都这样了，就把能做的全都做到最好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
