{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "79e9a479cf7f58ba4e6980a535c9fb5076aca60e282a711eb95f875864d54ab8", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、音楽特番『シンギングスター』！\nできる限りの準備はしてきた……）", "zh": "（今天终于要参加音乐特别节目《歌唱之星》了！能做的准备都已经做了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d631a3a7f2d746113c86c0bd9426226ad94ee791fea21a533eeabf6f3db2a5ac", "ja": "（客席は満員！　春香と伊織はステージで、\n貴音と雪歩は舞台袖で、それぞれスタンバイ中だ）", "zh": "（观众席座无虚席！春香和伊织在舞台上，\n贵音和雪步在舞台侧边，各自待机中）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1042_008tak", "source_sha256": "4bc9992121b6db4292a92f52d7faea37746bcacf966d8e89bbc72829e7111e47", "ja": "……ふぅ。", "zh": "……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ccef5943a6880297f9a798e20ab9c3097bded93d9a73b8119c237d4a07b7e56b", "ja": "あ、あの、四条さん……。\nもしかして、緊張してますか？", "zh": "啊、那个，四条小姐……\n难道说，你很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "37c731a20c63cb1f6821ab1a96cbbfad57072af8f0d9dce0bbc4b27d7a4e5883", "ja": "おや……。", "zh": "哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "271ce9bbef03e906db7e9ecef0f2ebb7ae6b05942e0c51ea59b2ad43cd67a7fd", "ja": "あっ、違ったらごめんなさい！\nなんとなく、そんな気がしたっていうか……。", "zh": "啊，要是不对的话，真是不好意思！\n只是隐约有种这样的感觉……···", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1046_008tak", "source_sha256": "e4f1c3f6f03b2aa4c1332d46026443e3766166510fe20d1b5f177fe7d60f92a1", "ja": "いえ、ふふっ……見抜かれてしまいましたね。\nそうです。春香と伊織には、内緒ですよ？", "zh": "不，呵呵……被您看穿了呢。\n正是如此。不过对春香和伊织，要保密哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1047_008tak", "source_sha256": "377b9e7c068902daf0dd373c612e4b4925ae3c0a12a4fd9beadc004d600be0cd", "ja": "由緒ある番組に、素晴らしい共演者の皆様。\n皆の期待……流石に、重責を感じてはいます。", "zh": "在这档历史悠久的节目中，还有各位优秀的共演者。\n大家的期待……我确实感受到了沉重的责任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b91d6534da80d385d04d16b7c2ad8d8497f8e2f6870f480f8eae82afd6c1a91b", "ja": "で、ですよね……私も改めて、こんなに大きな番組で\n司会をするって思ったら、足が震えてきちゃって……。", "zh": "是、是啊……我重新一想，自己竟然要在这么重要的节目里担任主持，腿都开始发抖了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "801564ac244c38bfa14fc51418e5e1d0c411e7c781983d27c473f698eabdfde5", "ja": "でも……ふふっ。四条さんも同じだったんですね。\nなんだか……嬉しいなぁ。", "zh": "不过……呵呵，四条小姐原来也和我一样呢。总觉得……好开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "010146bd37238c1709b1602c46cc126783c83f42871cf2963ea904bc0989bbb7", "ja": "嬉しい……？", "zh": "高兴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1051_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2445bbdaa5c5b25bc2a059f21eca49db33c0a7f8214b591221e2dcb33efb63a7", "ja": "はい。この緊張が四条さんと\nお揃いだって思うと、ちょっと嬉しいっていうか……。", "zh": "是的。一想到这份紧张感和四条小姐是一样的，就觉得有点开心……或者说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1052_008tak", "source_sha256": "585c45454bd7f5a19c38d2d07d9530e005df5b176013d1080fed51acfd528953", "ja": "緊張が、お揃い……。ふふっ、そう言われると、\nなにやら嬉しい気持ちがいたしますね。", "zh": "紧张也能和我相同……呵呵，听您这么说，我不知为何也感到很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2d42550fe2ee37b3ae264618380d8db68d31058beb66292925fc4cdc719b0353", "ja": "本当ですか？　……えへへ♪\nじゃあ、嬉しいって気持ちもお揃いですね！", "zh": "真的吗？……嘿嘿♪\n那我们连开心的心情也是一样的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1054_008tak", "source_sha256": "61c0b65c1633f8b5dcb1e6adb265bd764e06992a698d06853e9db17d4df59ded", "ja": "雪歩、以前言いましたが……あなたは強いです。\n悲しい時、苦しい時でも、誰かを思いやれる人です。", "zh": "雪步，我以前说过……你很坚强。即使悲伤、痛苦的时候，你也是会为他人着想的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1055_008tak", "source_sha256": "c30d39ef09535361493858be2202d47fef5cdc34e7ccabf7a81a3117b3033cd1", "ja": "あなたとなら、どんな内容になったとしても、\n楽しい時を過ごせることでしょう。", "zh": "只要与你在一起，无论内容如何，\n想必都能度过一段愉快的时光吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1056_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f2cb34ff8cd02dbca3b88c8cf86d47dd6c0bc1d095ec452ba0b482bfe925c515", "ja": "四条さん……。はい、楽しませてみせますっ！\n四条さんのことも、お客さんも、みんなも！", "zh": "四条小姐……嗯，我一定会让大家开心起来的！\n无论是四条小姐，还是各位观众，所有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_05_1057_audience", "source_sha256": "66c5aed25b5fb8345093e4be158a7ecf1229bf1d12c07d0c58ac58a3272b4a2f", "ja": "ワアアァァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
